 "requested_at": "2026-11-13T20:16:00.193011Z",
 "text": "{\"verdict\":\"allowed\",\"section\":\"14\",\"quote\":\"A provision in a tenancy agreement prohibiting the presence of animals in or about the residential complex is void.\",\"reason\":\"Section 14 only invalidates provisions that prohibit the presence of animals in or about the residential complex. Requiring dogs to be leashed in common areas and requiring tenants to clean up after them does not prohibit their presence and is therefore permitted.\"}",
